//! The `font-variant-east-asian` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property
//! controls the use of alternate glyphs for East Asian scripts, like Japanese and Chinese.
//!
//! Initial: normal. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: normal | [ <east-asian-variant-values> || <east-asian-width-values> || ruby ]
